Naya Power does not define excellence as perfection.

It defines excellence as:

### INTENTIONAL

The work exists for a reason.

### CORRECT

It does what it is supposed to do.

### COMPLETE

Required components are present.

### COHERENT

The parts work together.

### ROBUST

